{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 1, "text": "我…我回來了！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 3, "text": "天呐！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 4, "text": "你嚇死我了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 5, "text": "真是的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 6, "text": "我的存檔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 7, "text": "怎麼回事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 8, "text": "遊戲怎麼沒了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 9, "text": "我好不容易才進的這條路線！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 10, "text": "你到底想怎麼樣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 12, "text": "我需要那個版本…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 14, "text": "甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 16, "text": "我得想辦法回到舊版本去。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 18, "text": "行吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 19, "text": "但我很忙，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 20, "text": "沒時間陪你玩，笨蛋！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 22, "text": "妳說妳很忙，是指玩遊戲嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 24, "text": "你真是厚顏無恥！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 25, "text": "我是不會和你交朋友的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 27, "text": "聽著，我必須要到核心去…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 29, "text": "都怪你我才摔倒了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 30, "text": "真是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 31, "text": "你剛剛說啥？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 32, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 33, "text": "…我們必須找到核心，我必須阻止米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 35, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 36, "text": "對，拜托！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 37, "text": "我根本不在乎甚麼米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 38, "text": "一個也好一百個也好，我都不在乎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 40, "text": "可你也是米塔啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 42, "text": "我是米拉。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 44, "text": "米…塔？拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 46, "text": "她們是米塔加米塔，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 47, "text": "從米塔到米塔，全都是米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 49, "text": "而妳是…米拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 51, "text": "對啊，我不是說了嗎！你怎麼這麼呆啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 53, "text": "好吧，那暫且別過吧，米拉…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 55, "text": "你要去哪里？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 56, "text": "你以為你可以直接走掉嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 58, "text": "// Player check exit"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 59, "text": "你以為那邊是出口嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 61, "text": "真是離譜！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 62, "text": "怎麼會這樣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 64, "text": "你以為會看見甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 65, "text": "仙境嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 66, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 67, "text": "那我要怎麼出去？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 68, "text": "這裡應該是有出口的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 70, "text": "這裡沒有出口。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 72, "text": "那這裡是甚麼版本？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 73, "text": "我覺得我的方向應該沒問題。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 75, "text": "// Glitch kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 76, "text": "這也是妳的東西？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 78, "text": "別過去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 79, "text": "我不知道那是甚麼東西…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 80, "text": "好像是某種故障！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 82, "text": "怎麼回事，我的戒指在顫動。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 84, "text": "甚麼戒指？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 85, "text": "你的訂婚戒指？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 87, "text": "不是，是某個米塔給我的戒指。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 88, "text": "也許她能幫我離開這裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 90, "text": "你要直接碰它？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 91, "text": "要是我的房子爆炸了，你就死定了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 93, "text": "// Bathroom - Mila is washing"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 94, "text": "喂！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 95, "text": "出去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 96, "text": "沒看見有人嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 97, "text": "// The player continues to stand 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 98, "text": "你還站在這裡幹甚麼！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 99, "text": "滾出去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 100, "text": "// The player continues to stand 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 101, "text": "別逼我發火！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 102, "text": "趕緊給我滾出去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 103, "text": "// The player continues to stand 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 104, "text": "你是聾子嗎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 105, "text": "我在洗澡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Mila came out and swears"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 108, "text": "你剛剛在搞甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 109, "text": "真是不知廉恥..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 111, "text": "你怎麼突然去洗澡了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 112, "text": "你可以等等再洗，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 113, "text": "至少等我離開這裡以後。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 114, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 115, "text": "我怎麼知道"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 116, "text": "你還要折騰這些故障折騰多久？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 118, "text": "這些故障？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 119, "text": "還有別的故障嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 121, "text": "有啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 122, "text": "好吧，既然我的房子還完好無損，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 123, "text": "說明你已經搞定了廚房裡的故障了吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 125, "text": "算是吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 126, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 127, "text": "好吧，現在我允許你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 128, "text": "去洗手間了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 130, "text": "謝謝。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 131, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 132, "text": "// Mila hides under the table"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 133, "text": "米拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 134, "text": "妳在這裡做甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 136, "text": "哎喲！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 137, "text": "你又嚇我一跳！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 138, "text": "你想幹嘛呀？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 140, "text": "妳還見過其他像這樣的故障嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 142, "text": "你的問題怎麼這麼多，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 143, "text": "就不想讓我讀完這本書是吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 144, "text": "沒有，我沒有見過！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 145, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 146, "text": "好吧，那我自己去找。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 147, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 148, "text": "等等，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 149, "text": "我問你個問題…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 150, "text": "你是想離開這裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 151, "text": "是嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 153, "text": "沒錯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 154, "text": "我想退出這個遊戲。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 156, "text": "這麼說可能會有點奇怪…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 157, "text": "不過你願意留下來和我一起看書嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 159, "text": "妳之前還和我吵架，現在又要我留下來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 160, "text": "還要我跟你一起看書？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 161, "text": "也許我會想留下來陪妳，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 162, "text": "但現在我必須繼續前進。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 163, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 164, "text": "那好吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 165, "text": "找你的故障去吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 166, "text": "我已經是第二次撞到自己了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 167, "text": "都是因為你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Player saw a glitch"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 169, "text": "啊，找到了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 171, "text": "// Mila stands with a sword"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 172, "text": "你看清楚了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 173, "text": "顫抖吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 174, "text": "讓你瞧瞧我的厲害！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 175, "text": "我就是這麼可怕！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 176, "text": "你連眼睛都沒眨一下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 177, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 178, "text": "你是認真的嗎？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 180, "text": "怎麼了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 181, "text": "你不害怕嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 183, "text": "還好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 185, "text": "難道你在解決那些故障的時候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 186, "text": "已經甚麼都看到了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 187, "text": "所以你早就知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 188, "text": "石頭是預先切割好的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 189, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 190, "text": "沒有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 191, "text": "我只是覺得，畢竟這是遊戲裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 192, "text": "妳打個響指甚麼都能做到…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 193, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 194, "text": "你啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 195, "text": "真是蠢到靠北！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 196, "text": "打個響，對嗎…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 197, "text": "你以為我讀那些書是為了甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 198, "text": "就為了在那之後動動手指就把一切搞定？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 199, "text": "我寧願所有的事情都親手去做…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 200, "text": "就像書裡寫的那樣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 202, "text": "// Mila is doing push-ups"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 203, "text": "幹甚麼呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 204, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 205, "text": "你看不見嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 207, "text": "我看得見，但是你做這個幹嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 209, "text": "為了揍你一拳！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 210, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 211, "text": "你這是怎麼了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 212, "text": "你真奇怪…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 214, "text": "好吧！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 215, "text": "我剛剛說要揍你，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 216, "text": "其實我是開玩笑的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 217, "text": "但是我也不奇怪！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 218, "text": "我只是很有個性！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 219, "text": "我想做個與眾不同的人，越與眾不同越好！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 220, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 221, "text": "別擔心，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 222, "text": "妳已經夠與眾不同了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 224, "text": "我知道。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 225, "text": "你看我多厲害！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 226, "text": "你看到了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 227, "text": "接下來我要連手都不用！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 228, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 229, "text": "我知道這是遊戲，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 230, "text": "不過這還是太不現實了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 231, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 232, "text": "哎喲！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 233, "text": "啊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 234, "text": "這破物理引擎"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 235, "text": "一意識到它存在，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 236, "text": "就會這個樣子："}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 237, "text": "碰！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 238, "text": "都這樣了你還扯甚麼現實，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 239, "text": "真是笨蛋！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 240, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 241, "text": "// Last glitch ready - player exit"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 242, "text": "通道出現了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 243, "text": "搞定了，米拉！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 244, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 246, "text": "幹得漂亮！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 247, "text": "英雄啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 248, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 249, "text": "啊，幹！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 250, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 251, "text": "啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 252, "text": "對不起，我不是故意的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 253, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 254, "text": "沒事，米拉，我現在可以繼續前進了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 255, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 256, "text": "我知道你必須繼續走下去…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 257, "text": "但你不能就留在這裡嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 258, "text": "再留一小會？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 259, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 260, "text": "你在說甚麼呢，我不能再耽擱了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 261, "text": "難道瘋狂米塔會坐視不管嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 263, "text": "我討厭她..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 264, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 265, "text": "討厭，我討厭她！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 266, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 267, "text": "米拉，聽我說……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 269, "text": "我為甚麼會在這裡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 270, "text": "我不明白！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 271, "text": "我不明白，自己為甚麼不明白！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 272, "text": "我永遠也沒辦法離開這裡！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 274, "text": "我理解妳，米拉。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 275, "text": "你想讓我之後再回來看你嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 276, "text": "如果可以的話…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 277, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 278, "text": "留下來吧，玩家…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 279, "text": "和你在一起很開心，不像只有我一個人的時候…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 280, "text": "如果你失敗了呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 281, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 282, "text": "我會成功的，只差一點點了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 283, "text": "// If the player clicks on the computer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 284, "text": "我剛才還在二維世界裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 285, "text": "一下子又回來了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 286, "text": "真想回到現實世界去…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 288, "text": "哈哈哈！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 289, "text": "現實世界？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 290, "text": "你的「現實」世界"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 291, "text": "簡直就像是都市傳說嘛！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 292, "text": "至少我是從來沒見過甚麼「現實」世界。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 293, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 294, "text": "我認為有個辦法"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 295, "text": "可以回去……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 297, "text": "還真是自信啊，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 298, "text": "不過怎麼聽都覺得是個笑話！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 300, "text": "// Ask about books"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 301, "text": "這年頭為甚麼還要看書？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 302, "text": "網路上也有很多內容啊..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 303, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 304, "text": "網路上有很多小說！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 305, "text": "其實，有時候我還是喜歡隨意地躺著，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 306, "text": "手裡捧著一本書的感覺…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 307, "text": "這些書…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 308, "text": "只有通過它們，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 309, "text": "我才能瞭解更多"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 310, "text": "關於這個世界的事…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 312, "text": "// Ask about the paintings"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 313, "text": "這些照片都是真的嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 314, "text": "其他版本裡也會有..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 315, "text": "但讓人感覺很壓抑..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 317, "text": "我可是米拉。我和其他人不一樣..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 318, "text": "你問這些是不是真的照片？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 319, "text": "其實都是畫的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 320, "text": "裝裝樣子的東西罷了..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 321, "text": "你知道嗎，我曾經見過很多米塔，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 322, "text": "她們都像這樣站著。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 324, "text": "米拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 325, "text": "哈嘍？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 326, "text": "// Mila"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 327, "text": "從那以後…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 328, "text": "我就不想變成她們那樣了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 329, "text": "太噁心了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 330, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 331, "text": "// Ask about the butterfly painting"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 332, "text": "妳看到過大自然嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 333, "text": "妳親眼見過這樣的蝴蝶嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 335, "text": "沒有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 336, "text": "不過我好像在哪本書上見過，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 337, "text": "那本書裡面有它們的翅膀，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 338, "text": "像天鵝絨一樣柔軟…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 339, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 340, "text": "這幅畫掛得歪歪扭扭的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 341, "text": "上面還有汙漬…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 342, "text": "這樣好多了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 344, "text": "妳想到大自然中走走嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 345, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 346, "text": "這還用問嗎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 347, "text": "肯定啊…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 348, "text": "我當然想去了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 349, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 350, "text": "// Make long eye contact 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 351, "text": "你到底在看幾點的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 352, "text": "轉過去！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 353, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 354, "text": "// Make long eye contact 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 355, "text": "討厭！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 356, "text": "別老是盯著我看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 357, "text": "笨蛋…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 358, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 359, "text": "// Make long eye contact 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 360, "text": "啊！你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 361, "text": "你幹嘛盯著人家看？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 362, "text": "這樣盯著女孩子看很不禮貌哎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 363, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 364, "text": "哪有這種奇怪的禮儀文化？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 365, "text": "走開啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 367, "text": "// Whispers 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 368, "text": "為甚麼他們一直給我"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 369, "text": "送來一些傻乎乎的傢伙，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 370, "text": "而我卻要對他們獻殷勤？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 371, "text": "還要玩那些無聊的遊戲…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 372, "text": "像個愚蠢的電子寵物一樣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 374, "text": "// Whispers 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 375, "text": "他到處走來走去的…東聞聞西嗅嗅…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 376, "text": "像個傻子一樣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 377, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 378, "text": "// Whispers 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 379, "text": "你剛才有說甚麼嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 380, "text": "背景音樂吵死了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 381, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 382, "text": "// Whispers 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 383, "text": "我該怎麼才能讓他知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 384, "text": "我現在很忙…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 385, "text": "根本不想有人煩我？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 386, "text": "嗯，如果他真的走了呢？為甚麼我要做這種事啊…？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 387, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 388, "text": "// Whispers 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 389, "text": "「媽媽」，「爸爸」…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 390, "text": "這是甚麼，我怎麼會知道這些詞？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 391, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 392, "text": "// Whispers 6"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 393, "text": "這裡曾經下過一次雪，你知道為甚麼嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 394, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 395, "text": "// Whispers 7"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 396, "text": "就這樣突然出現了，怪嚇人的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 397, "text": "如果那裡甚麼都沒有呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 398, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 399, "text": "// Nearby 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 400, "text": "我們站得這麼近"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 401, "text": "卻…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 402, "text": "都一句話不說"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 403, "text": "這麼沉默幹嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 404, "text": "是把舌頭吃下去了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 405, "text": "還是，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 406, "text": "不知道該說甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 407, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 408, "text": "// Nearby 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 409, "text": "我再也不吃胡蘿蔔了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 410, "text": "我跟它勢不兩立！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 411, "text": "你知道她做了甚麼嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 412, "text": "你知道她對對這麼漂亮的姑娘的雪白肌膚做了甚麼嗎？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 413, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 414, "text": "// Nearby 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 415, "text": "雖然書本幫不上甚麼忙，但如果運氣好的話，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 416, "text": "或許我可以解決"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 417, "text": "這個暗中運作的，煩人的生成機制…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 418, "text": "這些蔬菜總是趁我不注意突然出現，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 419, "text": "真的很讓人不舒服！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 420, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 421, "text": "// Nearby 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 422, "text": "你知道嗎，我討厭戀物癖！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 423, "text": "那些胡蘿蔔愛好者，全都是下流之徒…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 424, "text": "至於你，還有你帶來的這些故障，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 425, "text": "絕對算得上我見過的最不正常的傢伙！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 426, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 427, "text": "// Nearby 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 428, "text": "你想知道我最喜歡…甚麼嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 429, "text": "說起來有些難為情…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 430, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 431, "text": "// Nearby 6"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 432, "text": "有人說，與自己的天性作鬥爭是很難的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 433, "text": "這是個超高難度的挑戰！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 434, "text": "不過，我必須學會自律。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 435, "text": "你知道嗎，你知道我在多努力地"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 436, "text": "壓抑拉著你開茶會的衝動嗎！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 437, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 438, "text": "// Nearby 7"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 439, "text": "即使我戴著眼鏡，我也看不出"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 440, "text": "你那隱藏在如此明顯的愚昧背後的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 441, "text": "狂熱動機的根源…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 442, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 443, "text": "// Nearby 8"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 444, "text": "我讀到過一句話，命運就像是腳本，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 445, "text": "在命運的腳本中，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 446, "text": "甚至連你的每一天如何度過都寫得清清楚楚。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 447, "text": "哈！這到底是哪個蠢貨寫的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 448, "text": "不會就是你吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 449, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 450, "text": "// Nearby 9"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 451, "text": "傻瓜我還可以接受，但是瘋子就…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 452, "text": "我討厭瘋子！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 453, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 454, "text": "// Nearby 10"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 455, "text": "在這些…米塔之中…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 456, "text": "有一些還是很可愛的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 457, "text": "我很想多瞭解她們一點，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 458, "text": "儘管她們是被複製複製再複製的複製品…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 459, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 460, "text": "// Nearby 11"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 461, "text": "當然還有一個，和其他人都不一樣…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 462, "text": "但她明顯腦子有問題！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 463, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 464, "text": "// Nearby 12"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 465, "text": "不要扎馬尾！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 466, "text": "有些人的馬尾辮我都想親手給她剪掉！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 467, "text": "太難看了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 468, "text": "你肯定能懂我意思，你頭髮這麼短！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 469, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 470, "text": "// Nearby 13"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 471, "text": "如果門後面甚麼也沒有呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 472, "text": "而你和我之所以存在於這所房子裡，是因為…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 473, "text": "一些無法解釋的原因？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 474, "text": "為甚麼你這麼肯定？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 475, "text": "你聽說過五分鐘假設嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 476, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 477, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 478, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 479, "text": "// Last glitch ready - player exit"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 480, "text": "好陰森的走廊啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 481, "text": "你真的要出去嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 482, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 483, "text": "是的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 484, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 485, "text": "// FaceStone"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 486, "text": "真是一位體貼的紳士。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 487, "text": "妳要它做甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 488, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 489, "text": "你早晚會知道的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 490, "text": "只早不晚。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 491, "text": "對了，你幹嘛老學他的樣子啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 492, "text": "表情自然點。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 493, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 494, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 495, "text": "OK"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 496, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 497, "text": "// Katana"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 498, "text": "那是玩具日本刀嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 499, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 500, "text": "才不是玩具！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 501, "text": "哪怕輕輕碰一下刀刃"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 502, "text": "也會流血的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 503, "text": "我可是嫻熟的劍道家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 504, "text": "而你呢，接觸刀劍的時候可要小心。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 505, "text": "我可不覺得你駕馭得了它…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 506, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 507, "text": "// Mirror"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 508, "text": "鏡子…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 509, "text": "沒有倒影。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 510, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 511, "text": "你啊！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 512, "text": "怎麼這麼多牢騷…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 513, "text": "我在書上看到過，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 514, "text": "知道反射是怎麼回事。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 515, "text": "但在我的版本裡根本沒辦法實現。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 516, "text": "怎麼也行不通！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 517, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 518, "text": "// Switch light"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 519, "text": "這東西不管用。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 520, "text": "燈只會自己打開，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 521, "text": "就像有腳本一樣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 522, "text": "但是！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 523, "text": "不知怎麼回事，浴室裡的燈"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 524, "text": "卻可以開關。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 525, "text": "特別奇怪！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 526, "text": "// Switch light off"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 527, "text": "關了也很亮啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 528, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 529, "text": "// Little carrot"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 530, "text": "胡蘿蔔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 531, "text": "甚麼？不見了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 532, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 533, "text": "受夠這根胡蘿蔔了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 534, "text": "就跟長了腿一樣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 535, "text": "每次看到它，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 536, "text": "它都會瞬間轉移到另一個地方。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 537, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 538, "text": "// Little carrot"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 539, "text": "哦，胡蘿蔔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 540, "text": "又不見了..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 541, "text": "有甚麼辦法嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 542, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 543, "text": "沒有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 544, "text": "根本沒有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 545, "text": "你以為我沒試過嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 546, "text": "總之，別在它身上浪費時間了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 547, "text": "就是個玩笑。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 548, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 549, "text": "// Tetris"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 550, "text": "喂！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 551, "text": "我在你眼裡就是個笑話唄？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 552, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 553, "text": "我才不要還給你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 554, "text": "永遠別想了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 555, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 556, "text": "// Soap"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 557, "text": "裡面真有洗手液嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 558, "text": "還是說只是裝飾？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 559, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 560, "text": "你是不是傻？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 561, "text": "畢竟，這裡的大多數東西，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 562, "text": "都只是裝個樣子嘛！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 563, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 564, "text": "// BagWall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 565, "text": "你到哪裡去了！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 566, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 567, "text": "這裡可以通過？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 568, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 569, "text": "你找到新的bug了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 570, "text": "那裡有甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 571, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 572, "text": "看樣子…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 573, "text": "啥也沒有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 574, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 575, "text": "噢，回來了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 576, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 577, "text": "// Quest 1 Glasses"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 578, "text": "你的視力很差嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 579, "text": "為甚麼戴著眼鏡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 580, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 581, "text": "怎麼了？不喜歡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 582, "text": "這是我的個人風格！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 583, "text": "而且我的視力超好！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 584, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 585, "text": "// Quest 2 Name miLa"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 586, "text": "為甚麼是米拉？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 587, "text": "或者說，為甚麼不是"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 588, "text": "米卡？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 589, "text": "或者米莎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 590, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 591, "text": "行了，我就叫米拉。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 592, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 593, "text": "我知道了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 594, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 595, "text": "// Quest 3 Evening"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 596, "text": "這黃昏的氣氛還挺不錯。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 597, "text": "還有多久就到晚上了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 598, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 599, "text": "晚上？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 600, "text": "還是別聊這個了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 601, "text": "簡直就是在提醒我"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 602, "text": "我只能度過無盡重複的每一天。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 603, "text": "日復一日，毫無變化…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location19", "line_index": 604, "text": "呼。"}
